7	/// Syntax: `{name}@{suffix}`
8	///
9	/// Examples:
10	/// * `ts-node@10.9.1`, `@types/node@18.7.19`, `typescript@5.1.6`
11	/// * `react-json-view@1.21.3(@types/react@17.0.49)(react-dom@17.0.2)(react@17.0.2)`
